      <main class="container py-4 o_ydental_inventory o_ydental_access_inventory">
<h1>Inventory workbench</h1><p><a href="/ydental/access">Store and access</a> | <a href="/ydental/inventory">Inventory</a> | <a href="/ydental/inventory/catalog">Group product catalog</a></p>
<t t-set="inventory_lookup" t-value="request.httprequest.path == '/ydental/inventory'"/>
<section t-if="not can_catalog or config" t-att-class="'o_ydental_inventory_lookup' if inventory_lookup else None" t-att-data-dl-scope="'inventory-lookup' if inventory_lookup else None" t-att-data-dl-region="'search' if inventory_lookup else None">
<h2>Find products, lots and consumption</h2>
<form action="/ydental/inventory" method="get"><label>Product or lot name <input name="q" maxlength="100" t-att-value="search_term"/></label><button type="submit" t-att-class="'o_ydental_inventory_action o_ydental_inventory_action_primary' if inventory_lookup else None" t-att-data-dl-actions="'inventory-actions' if inventory_lookup else None"><t t-if="inventory_lookup"><t t-call="ydental_inventory.p7_icon_search"/><span class="o_ydental_inventory_action_label">Search</span></t><t t-else="">Search</t></button></form>
<p t-if="inventory_lookup">Lots match product or lot names. Source records also match product codes. Only source records are paginated.</p>
<p t-if="inventory_lookup" class="o_ydental_inventory_help">Submit the search to update the displayed results. Typing alone does not apply a new query.</p>
<p t-if="not inventory_lookup">Search only reads the current authorized store. Open a source to see its movement and responsibility.</p>
</section><h2 t-out="store.name"/><p>Native stock movements are authoritative. Suggested quantities require actual batch and quantity confirmation.</p>
<p t-if="not config or not config.ydental_policy_configured" class="alert alert-warning">Alert policy is not configured. No production thresholds are assumed.</p>
