<input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" t-att-value="request.csrf_token()"/><input type="hidden" name="revision" t-att-value="revision"/>
<input type="hidden" name="key" t-att-value="key()"/><input type="hidden" name="operation" value="recover"/><h4>Recover original event</h4><input type="hidden" name="event_id" t-att-value="e['id']"/><label>Evidence and reason<input class="form-control" name="reason" type="text" required="required"/></label><button type="submit" t-att-class="'o_ydental_inventory_action o_ydental_inventory_action_primary' if inventory_lookup else 'btn btn-primary'" t-att-data-dl-actions="'inventory-actions' if inventory_lookup else None"><t t-if="inventory_lookup"><span class="o_ydental_inventory_action_label">Confirm</span></t><t t-else="">Confirm</t></button></form></details></t></t></article><h2>Identify scan source</h2><form action="/ydental/inventory/scan" method="post" data-inventory-form="scan"><input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" t-att-value="request.csrf_token()"/><input type="hidden" name="revision" t-att-value="revision"/><label>Code<input name="code" required="required"/></label><button type="submit" t-att-class="'o_ydental_inventory_action o_ydental_inventory_action_secondary' if inventory_lookup else None" t-att-data-dl-actions="'inventory-actions' if inventory_lookup else None"><t t-if="inventory_lookup"><t t-call="ydental_inventory.p7_icon_scan_line"/><span class="o_ydental_inventory_action_label">Identify only</span></t><t t-else="">Identify only</t></button></form><p>Scanning does not authorize receipt. Outsourcing integration is not connected.</p><nav t-if="not can_catalog or config" t-att-class="'o_ydental_inventory_lookup' if inventory_lookup else None" t-att-data-dl-scope="'inventory-lookup' if inventory_lookup else None" t-att-data-dl-region="'pagination' if inventory_lookup else None" aria-label="Inventory source pages">
